    ["Few years ago it was peaceful here, but now it is difficult to live with barbarians roaming around.\nTry to take care of them. I know it's going to be hard to get everyone out, but even a few less of their kind will be a success.\nFor proof of defeating a few of them, bring me Brutetamers Staff and Fur Boots, this is their basic equipment.\nSo, would you like to help me?"] = "Few years ago it was peaceful here, but now it is difficult to live with barbarians roaming around.\nTry to take care of them. I know it's going to be hard to get everyone out, but even a few less of their kind will be a success.\nFor proof of defeating a few of them, bring me Brutetamers Staff and Fur Boots, this is their basic equipment.\nSo, would you like to help me?",
